#: src/postulo/plugins/maps/__init__.py
msgid "Maps"
msgstr "Kartes"

#: src/postulo/plugins/maps/__init__.py
msgid "Show where the companies are on a map, placing each postal address offline at its postcode or its town from tables kept on this server, or where you put it by hand; a contact's address and your own are drawn only when you ask, and their points are kept with them and erased with them. The map is drawn by Leaflet (BSD-2-Clause) over OpenStreetMap's tiles (© OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL) unless Settings chooses other tiles or none; OpenStreetMap then learns each viewer's address and the area they look at. Places come from GeoNames (CC BY 3.0; its postal codes CC BY 4.0), the country names from the Unicode CLDR through Babel, and the world outline from Natural Earth (public domain). Switched off, there is no map page and no address is placed; the coordinates already stored stay recorded and come back untouched when it is switched on again."
msgstr "Rādīt kartē, kur atrodas uzņēmumi, bezsaistē novietojot katru pasta adresi pie tās pasta indeksa vai apdzīvotās vietas pēc tabulām, kas glabājas šajā serverī, vai tur, kur jūs to novietojat manuāli; kontaktpersonas adrese un jūsu pašu adrese tiek zīmētas tikai tad, kad to lūdzat, un to punkti tiek glabāti un dzēsti kopā ar tām. Karti zīmē Leaflet (BSD-2-Clause) uz OpenStreetMap flīzēm (© OpenStreetMap līdzautori, ODbL), ja vien iestatījumos nav izvēlētas citas flīzes vai neviena; tādā gadījumā OpenStreetMap uzzina katra skatītāja adresi un apgabalu, ko viņš aplūko. Vietas nāk no GeoNames (CC BY 3.0; tā pasta indeksi — CC BY 4.0), valstu nosaukumi no Unicode CLDR caur Babel, bet pasaules kontūra no Natural Earth (publiskais domēns). Kad izslēgts, kartes lapas nav un neviena adrese netiek novietota; jau saglabātās koordinātas paliek saglabātas un atgriežas neskartas, kad to atkal ieslēdz."
